WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.332 --> 00:00:02.732
Open Sunsama works with any AI agent

2
00:00:03.317 --> 00:00:04.768
Claude, ChatGPT

3
00:00:04.788 --> 00:00:06.873
Cursor, and more can plan your day with you

4
00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:10.922
In Settings, open the MCP tab

5
00:00:10.942 --> 00:00:12.223
Copy the connector URL

6
00:00:14.322 --> 00:00:15.255
Paste it into Claude

7
00:00:15.275 --> 00:00:17.106
or ChatGPT as a new connector

8
00:00:17.883 --> 00:00:19.987
Sign in once, then choose Allow access

9
00:00:20.648 --> 00:00:22.178
There is no API key to paste

10
00:00:23.963 --> 00:00:24.823
Now just ask

11
00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:27.172
Plan my afternoon around the launch review

12
00:00:28.843 --> 00:00:30.524
The agent reads your day first

13
00:00:31.008 --> 00:00:32.940
Then it adds tasks and time blocks

14
00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.836
and they appear in the app as it works

15
00:00:36.563 --> 00:00:37.515
You stay in charge

16
00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:39.930
Move or change anything you like

17
00:00:40.463 --> 00:00:42.385
And since Open Sunsama is open source

18
00:00:42.793 --> 00:00:42.967
you can

19
00:00:42.987 --> 00:00:45.255
see exactly what your agent is allowed to do

